        "answer": {
          "short": "38 minutes.",
          "worked": "In ascending order, the times are:\n\n$27,27,28,29,29,31,32,32,35,37,38,38,38,41,41,42,42,46,46,47,48$.\n\nThere are 21 values, so the median is the 11th value.\n\n$$\\text{Median}=38\\text{ minutes}.$$",
